    <div style="background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3); border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 28px;">
      <div style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; color: #10b981; margin-bottom: 6px;">⚡ Quick Answer: Marks to Percentage Formula (2026)</div>
      <h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--app-text); margin-bottom: 8px;">How to Convert Marks to Percentage?</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--app-text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
